  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The Kjeldahl method of Nitrogen estimation fails for which of the following reaction products?</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0274_f7dc58105af1.png\" style=\"width: 523px; height: 255px;\" /></p>"
